    "organization": "1420a00a-88d1-47b5-a069-a49664bcde57",
    "name": "Toony Dev Core",
    "slug": "toony-dev-core",
    "description": "Toony Dev Core is the central software project management platform with integrated AI agent capabilities. It enables development teams to organize their work through organizations, projects, issues, milestones, and cycles, with granular role-based access control (Owner, Admin, Manager, Member, Viewer) and real-time collaboration via WebSockets.\r\n                                                                                                                                                                                                             \r\nStack: Django 5 + DRF (backend), Next.js 15 + React 19 (frontend), PostgreSQL, Redis, Docker Compose.\r\n                                                                                                                                                                                                             \r\n  Key features:                                                                                                                                                                                              \r\n  - Multi-organization management with teams, labels, and cross-org projects\r\n  - Issues with statuses, priorities, assignments, comments, and activity tracking\r\n  - Milestones and cycles for sprint planning\r\n  - AI Studio: configurable SubAgents and Skills per organization\r\n  - Toony Agents: autonomous agents with tasks, events, and API keys\r\n  - Importers from Linear, Jira, Trello, Asana, and GitHub Projects\r\n  - Repository integrations (GitHub, GitLab, Bitbucket) and external tool connections\r\n  - JWT authentication with silent refresh and hierarchical roles\r\n  - Real-time updates per project and agent",
    "short_summary": "AI workflow building",
    "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
